  "煮的饭、刚买的笔、我说的话": "Cooked rice; a pen just bought; what I said",
  "标记主语或宾语小句": "Marking subject or object clauses",
  "时间过得慢、害怕某人跑掉": "Time passes slowly; fear that someone will run away",
  "表示目的或方式": "Expressing purpose or manner",
  "邀请某人吃饭、按照爷爷说的做": "Invite someone to eat; do as grandfather said",
  "在句末确认事态": "Confirming a situation at the end of a clause",
  "他吃过了的、我是从长沙来的": "He has indeed eaten; I came from Changsha",
  "描写静止的空间关系": "Describing a static spatial relation",
