  "连接小句：时间、目的与条件": "Linking clauses: time, purpose and conditions",
  "一个小句可以为另一个小句说明时间、目的或条件。例如，“你来时，他已经回家了”用“你来时”交代后一句的时间背景。": "One clause can supply the time, purpose or condition for another. For example, in ‘When you came, he had already gone home’, ‘when you came’ provides the time frame for the other clause.",
