  "代词可以指说话的人、听话的人或另一个人，也可以作主语或宾语。下面列出向亮记录的“我、你、他、我们、他们”。同一个词在例句中的声调有时与单独列词时不同，例句保留原书的读音。": "Pronouns refer to the speaker, the listener or someone else. They can be subjects or objects. The table gives Xiang’s forms for “I”, “you”, “he”, “we” and “they”. A word’s tone in a sentence sometimes differs from its tone when listed alone; the examples keep the source’s tones.",
